        "alt_chirho": "Warm watercolor of a blank unfurled scroll on a stone table beneath an olive tree. A wooden lyre and bronze-colored crown stand behind it; a curved staff rests against folded woven cloth. An olive branch and wildflowers frame the foreground, with terraced hills and a distant stone town beyond.",
