        "art_review_chirho": "pending",
        "reading_note_chirho": "This imagined still life reflects the genealogy announced in Matthew 1:1. The scroll evokes the ancestral record; the lyre and crown recall David, while the staff and woven cloth recall Abraham. The olive branch suggests family descent. The verse does not describe these objects together, and they are not presented as historical relics. Jesus Christ, whose genealogy is introduced, remains out of view."
